WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.360
Why didn't you buy bread? Why did you bring this brick again?

2
00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:15.360
Andrija, why do we have the same conversation every morning?

3
00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:18.360
So, we agreed to eat healthy organic bread.

4
00:00:18.360 --> 00:00:25.360
Made of buckwheat flour, with flax seeds, with pumpkin and so on.

5
00:00:25.360 --> 00:00:29.360
Every nutritionist recommends it and that's how we'll start the day, okay?

6
00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:36.360
What's wrong with you? What's wrong with it?

7
00:00:36.360 --> 00:00:38.360
This wasn't made by a baker but by a car mechanic.

8
00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:43.360
Come on, come on, we made a compromise: eggs are fine, bacon is fine, but healthy bread is a must.

9
00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:49.360
And why don't you buy me normal bread, the kind all normal people eat, so I can dip these eggs, so I can eat normally?

10
00:01:04.530 --> 00:01:06.530
Why do I even bother? I don't know why I bother.

11
00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:11.530
I should have bought you one sausage to eat,

12
00:01:11.530 --> 00:01:15.530
just bought you a burek, greasy, 300 grams,

13
00:01:15.530 --> 00:01:19.530
and you'd eat that. And this costs 500 dinars, man.

14
00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:24.530
Then it has to last seven days. – Seven days? – That's right.

15
00:01:24.530 --> 00:01:27.530
This will last seven years, Andjelka.
